/*
	SCRAP METAL
	Junk gear beaten out of scrap slag; cooked from common rock in any big furnace or the slag kiln, or left behind
	whenever a smith ruins a bar. It mirrors the decrepit line, but anyone can forge it, it can never be repaired,
	and it only ever smelts back down into scrap slag - never into anything that could become gilbranze.
*/

